kunsten_be_flanders_7858eb98a09d,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/tussenruimte-zoekt-kunstenaars-voor-festival-de-kunst-van-rouw/,https://forms.gle/x2goSp6KNzq3RVms9,Tussenruimte,"Tussenruimte (Berchem) is looking for artists to take part in a co-creation and festival: De Kunst van Rouw (November 7–15 2026). Together with RetroRouw vzw, we are organising a multi-day arts festival around grief and loss. Through three collective meet-ups, we build towards a group exhibition together.","All artistic disciplines are welcome — visual art, performance, music, poetry, photography, and food.",festival,,Berchem,,,Both emerging and established artists are encouraged to apply.,en,Tussenruimte is looking for artists,"All artistic disciplines are welcome — visual art, performance, music, poetry, photography, and food. Both emerging and established artists are encouraged to apply.",Tussenruimte is looking for artists,"All artistic disciplines are welcome — visual art, performance, music, poetry, photography, and food. Both emerging and established artists are encouraged to apply.",30 June.,2027-06-30,2026-09-23 12:37:25.164319+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_32c6d7691640,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-what-the-drag-performers/,https://forms.gle/iY2WMSgNikUfNWTUA,Dwaalzin,"What the Drag?! is a volunteer-led project from Dwaalzin that creates a platform for emerging drag performers and queer voices. We aim to give beginning drag artists the space to experiment, perform, and connect with others, while introducing drag as an art form to a wider audience in an accessible and welcoming way.",drag,performance opportunity,Belgium,Brussels,Compensation: €100 for one act €130 for two acts,,emerging,en,Open call – What the Drag?! performers,"We are looking for emerging drag performers (of all styles and backgrounds). You can apply with limited or growing experience, this platform is specifically intended as a space to experiment, try out ideas, and grow as an artist. We welcome applicants of all identities, bodies, and backgrounds. If you have specific needs or questions regarding accessibility, we are open to discussing this together.",Open call – What the Drag?! performers,"We are looking for emerging drag performers (of all styles and backgrounds). You can apply with limited or growing experience, this platform is specifically intended as a space to experiment, try out ideas, and grow as an artist. We welcome applicants of all identities, bodies, and backgrounds. If you have specific needs or questions regarding accessibility, we are open to discussing this together.",28 Jun 2026,2026-06-28,2026-09-23 12:37:25.167364+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_2dc1c2458880,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/residency-the-resonant-garden/,,Kasteel Wijlre estate,"Kasteel Wijlre estate invites international artists to apply for The Resonant Garden, a three-month residency set within the green surroundings of Kasteel Wijlre estate’s grounds and gardens.",artists,Residency,the Netherlands,Wijlre,"The residency includes a stipend of € 800,- per month for three months, and a production and research compensation of max. € 2,000,-.",,,en,Residency – The Resonant Garden,"This call is open to artists living in the EU with both research- and studio-based practices who wish to engage with the garden as a metaphor, a method and/or a material environment. Applicants should embrace and value the rural location and the sense of quiet and relative isolation that living and working on a country estate entail.",Residency – The Resonant Garden,"This call is open to artists living in the EU with both research- and studio-based practices who wish to engage with the garden as a metaphor, a method and/or a material environment. Applicants should embrace and value the rural location and the sense of quiet and relative isolation that living and working on a country estate entail.",28 Jun 2026,2026-06-28,2026-09-23 12:37:25.170322+00:00
